Demonstration License - games/demo

Copyright (c) 2025 Antonin Fischer. All rights reserved.

SCOPE. This licence covers everything under `games/demo`: its scenes, dialogs,
puzzles, translations, stylesheet and assets. It does not cover `games/tests`,
which is engine test code and is MIT like the rest of the engine.

WHY THIS IS SEPARATE. `games/demo` is a complete, playable game, not a sample
fragment. It exists in this public repository so that the engine can be seen
working and so its test suite has real data to run against. It is not a free
copy of a product.

WHAT IS GRANTED. You may read this material, run it locally, and use it to
evaluate or develop the engine.

WHAT IS NOT GRANTED. No permission is given to copy, publish, distribute,
sublicense, sell, rent or lend it, in whole or in part, modified or not. No
permission is given to use it in paid or institutional teaching, which requires a
licence purchased from the copyright holder.

THE OTHER GAMES. The commercial games are not in this repository. They are
licensed per school and delivered by the hosted runtime.

For licensing enquiries, contact the copyright holder.
